{
  "schemaVersion": 1,
  "credit": "Powered By RagazzoInGamba - Marco Laudati",
  "target": "OpenPad Windows x64 + self-contained .NET runtime + NativeAOT setup runtime",
  "notes": [
    "Package hashes identify the exact NuGet archives used for license extraction. Upstream license files are pinned to the NuSpec repository commit; ViGEm.NET commit is resolved from official tag v1.21.256.",
    "SoundFlow upstream third-party notices are retained unmodified and describe optional components too. OpenPad ships only its MiniAudio backend (WAV, MP3, FLAC); FFmpeg codec package and soundflow-ffmpeg.dll are excluded. No FFmpeg/LAME compliance claim is made for the inherited optional upstream GUI build.",
    "MiniAudio license is additionally retained from the SoundFlow 1.4.1 submodule commit. Its upstream license offers Unlicense or MIT No Attribution. This catalog retains third-party authorship unchanged.",
    "ANGLE additional license texts follow its pinned BUILD.gn and DEPS (commit 1c89805903c1482166356d3b950d474973180e61): xxHash, Chromium zlib, Arm ASTC encoder, and conditional Abseil. This is a conservative attribution set from source configuration, not an assertion of object-level reproducibility. Vulkan/SwiftShader are disabled by the upstream Windows workflow. ASTC header is retained unchanged with its source copyright notice.",
    "packageSha512 hashes the signed .nupkg archive bytes; nugetContentHash is the normalized NuGet restore contentHash also recorded in deps.json. These are different values for signed packages and are checked separately."
  ],
